{
  "format": "manim-jupyter",
  "version": 6,
  "cells": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "# 七种 Scene 基类综合示例\n\n每个 Manim Cell 右下角都显示自己的 Scene 基类。相同基类的连续 Manim Cell 共用一个 Scene 段；切换基类会开始新的 Scene 段，因此不同基类之间不会继承对象或相机状态。\n\n下面把七种基类放在同一份 Notebook 中，每一节都包含多个连续 Cell。",
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyterTypst": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "## Scene\n\n普通二维场景。第二个 Cell 会继续操作第一个 Cell 创建的对象。",
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyterTypst": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyter": {
          "sceneClass": "Scene"
        }
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": "title = Text(\"Scene · 2D\", font_size=32, color=YELLOW).to_edge(UP)\nshape = Square(color=BLUE, fill_opacity=0.35)\nself.play(Write(title), DrawBorderThenFill(shape))\nself.wait(0.5)"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyter": {
          "sceneClass": "Scene"
        }
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": "target = Circle(color=GREEN, fill_opacity=0.35)\nself.play(Transform(shape, target))\nself.play(shape.animate.shift(RIGHT * 2).rotate(PI))\nself.wait(0.5)"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "# ThreeDScene 三维动画示例\n\n这个 Notebook 默认使用 `ThreeDScene`，不需要在 Cell 中编写 `class Demo(ThreeDScene)`。从上到下运行即可依次看到：\n\n1. 三维坐标系与双曲抛物面；\n2. 空间螺旋线和沿路径运动的 `Dot3D`；\n3. `Cube`、`Sphere` 及三维旋转；\n4. 环绕相机与视角切换。\n\n所有 Manim Cell 属于同一个连续三维场景，后面的 Cell 会继续使用前面创建的 `axes` 和 `surface`。也可以在右下角切换成 `SpecialThreeDScene` 后重新运行进行对比。",
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyterTypst": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyter": {
          "sceneClass": "ThreeDScene"
        }
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": "title = Text(\"ThreeDScene · continuous 3D cells\", font_size=30, color=YELLOW).to_edge(UP)\nself.add_fixed_in_frame_mobjects(title)\nself.set_camera_orientation(phi=68 * DEGREES, theta=-42 * DEGREES, zoom=0.8)\n\naxes = ThreeDAxes(\n    x_range=[-3, 3, 1],\n    y_range=[-3, 3, 1],\n    z_range=[-2, 2, 1],\n    x_length=6,\n    y_length=6,\n    z_length=4,\n)\nsurface = Surface(\n    lambda u, v: axes.c2p(u, v, 0.35 * (u ** 2 - v ** 2)),\n    u_range=[-2, 2],\n    v_range=[-2, 2],\n    resolution=(18, 18),\n    checkerboard_colors=[BLUE_D, BLUE_E],\n    fill_opacity=0.65,\n    stroke_width=0.35,\n)\n\nself.play(Write(title))\nself.play(Create(axes), FadeIn(surface), run_time=2.0)\nself.wait(0.5)"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyter": {
          "sceneClass": "ThreeDScene"
        }
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": "helix = ParametricFunction(\n    lambda t: axes.c2p(1.25 * np.cos(2 * t), 1.25 * np.sin(2 * t), t / PI - 1.5),\n    t_range=[0, 3 * PI],\n    color=YELLOW,\n    stroke_width=5,\n)\nrunner = Dot3D(point=helix.get_start(), radius=0.1, color=RED)\n\nself.play(Create(helix), FadeIn(runner))\nself.play(MoveAlongPath(runner, helix), run_time=2.5, rate_func=linear)\nself.wait(0.5)"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyter": {
          "sceneClass": "ThreeDScene"
        }
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": "cube = Cube(side_length=0.9, fill_color=GREEN, fill_opacity=0.65).move_to(axes.c2p(-1.5, -1.2, 0.8))\nsphere = Sphere(radius=0.55, resolution=(12, 24), fill_color=PURPLE, fill_opacity=0.7).move_to(axes.c2p(1.5, 1.0, 0.7))\n\nself.play(FadeIn(cube), FadeIn(sphere))\nself.play(\n    Rotate(cube, angle=PI, axis=UP + RIGHT),\n    sphere.animate.shift(OUT * 0.8),\n    run_time=1.8,\n)\nself.wait(0.5)"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyter": {
          "sceneClass": "ThreeDScene"
        }
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": "camera_note = Text(\"ambient rotation → move_camera\", font_size=24, color=GREEN).to_edge(DOWN)\ncamera_note.set_opacity(0)\nself.add_fixed_in_frame_mobjects(camera_note)\nself.play(camera_note.animate.set_opacity(1))\n\nself.begin_ambient_camera_rotation(rate=0.3)\nself.play(surface.animate.set_fill(GREEN, opacity=0.55), run_time=1.5)\nself.wait(1.0)\nself.stop_ambient_camera_rotation()\nself.move_camera(phi=75 * DEGREES, theta=25 * DEGREES, zoom=0.95, run_time=1.8)\nself.play(Indicate(title, color=GREEN))\nself.wait(0.5)"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "# MovingCameraScene 示例\n\n这个 Notebook 使用可移动二维相机。第一个 Cell 建立坐标平面和目标，后续 Cell 继续操作同一个 `self.camera.frame`，演示聚焦、跟随和恢复全景。",
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyterTypst": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyter": {
          "sceneClass": "MovingCameraScene"
        }
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": "plane = NumberPlane()\npath = CubicBezier(LEFT * 5 + DOWN * 2, LEFT * 2 + UP * 3, RIGHT * 2 + DOWN * 3, RIGHT * 5 + UP * 2, color=BLUE)\ntarget = Dot(path.get_start(), color=YELLOW, radius=0.14)\nlabel = Text(\"MovingCameraScene\", font_size=30, color=YELLOW).to_edge(UP)\nself.camera.frame.save_state()\nself.play(Create(plane), Create(path), FadeIn(target), Write(label))\nself.wait(0.5)"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyter": {
          "sceneClass": "MovingCameraScene"
        }
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": "self.play(self.camera.frame.animate.scale(0.45).move_to(target), run_time=1.2)\nself.play(MoveAlongPath(target, path), self.camera.frame.animate.move_to(path.get_end()), run_time=2.5, rate_func=linear)\nself.wait(0.5)"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyter": {
          "sceneClass": "MovingCameraScene"
        }
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": "self.play(Restore(self.camera.frame), run_time=1.5)\nself.play(Indicate(target, color=GREEN), Indicate(label, color=GREEN))\nself.wait(0.5)"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "# ZoomedScene 示例\n\n这个 Notebook 演示局部放大镜。放大窗口在第一个 Cell 激活，后续 Cell 继续移动同一个目标和 `zoomed_camera.frame`。",
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyterTypst": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyter": {
          "sceneClass": "ZoomedScene"
        }
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": "plane = NumberPlane()\ncurve = FunctionGraph(lambda x: 0.15 * x ** 3 - x, x_range=[-4, 4], color=BLUE)\nfocus = Dot(curve.point_from_proportion(0.15), color=YELLOW, radius=0.1)\ntitle = Text(\"ZoomedScene\", font_size=30, color=YELLOW).to_edge(UP)\nself.add(plane, curve, focus)\nself.play(Write(title))\nself.zoomed_camera.frame.move_to(focus).set_color(YELLOW)\nself.activate_zooming(animate=True)\nself.wait(0.5)"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyter": {
          "sceneClass": "ZoomedScene"
        }
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": "destination = curve.point_from_proportion(0.82)\nself.play(focus.animate.move_to(destination), self.zoomed_camera.frame.animate.move_to(destination), run_time=2.2)\nself.play(self.zoomed_camera.frame.animate.scale(0.65), run_time=1.0)\nself.wait(0.5)"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyter": {
          "sceneClass": "ZoomedScene"
        }
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": "ring = Circle(radius=0.28, color=GREEN).move_to(destination)\nself.play(Create(ring), Indicate(focus, color=GREEN))\nself.wait(0.5)"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "# VectorScene 示例\n\n这个 Notebook 使用 `VectorScene` 的坐标平面、向量和坐标标注辅助方法。后续 Cell 会继续引用前面创建的向量。",
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyterTypst": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyter": {
          "sceneClass": "VectorScene"
        }
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": "title = Text(\"VectorScene\", font_size=30, color=YELLOW).to_edge(UP)\nself.play(Write(title))\nplane = self.add_plane(animate=True)\nvector_a = self.add_vector([3, 1], color=BLUE, animate=True)\ncoords_a = self.write_vector_coordinates(vector_a)\nself.wait(0.5)"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyter": {
          "sceneClass": "VectorScene"
        }
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": "vector_b = self.add_vector([-1, 2], color=GREEN, animate=True)\ncoords_b = self.write_vector_coordinates(vector_b)\nresult = Vector([2, 3], color=YELLOW)\nself.play(GrowArrow(result))\nself.wait(0.5)"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyter": {
          "sceneClass": "VectorScene"
        }
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": "parallelogram = Polygon(ORIGIN, vector_a.get_end(), result.get_end(), vector_b.get_end(), color=YELLOW, fill_opacity=0.18)\nself.play(Create(parallelogram))\nself.play(Indicate(vector_a), Indicate(vector_b), Indicate(result))\nself.wait(0.5)"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "# LinearTransformationScene 示例\n\n这个 Notebook 使用内置坐标平面和基向量演示矩阵变换。每个 Cell 都在同一个已变换空间上继续执行。",
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyterTypst": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyter": {
          "sceneClass": "LinearTransformationScene"
        }
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": "title = Text(\"LinearTransformationScene\", font_size=28, color=YELLOW).to_edge(UP)\nvector = self.add_vector([2, 1], color=YELLOW, animate=True)\nunit_square = Square(side_length=1, color=BLUE, fill_opacity=0.3).move_to(RIGHT * 0.5 + UP * 0.5)\nself.add_transformable_mobject(unit_square)\nself.play(Write(title), DrawBorderThenFill(unit_square))\nself.wait(0.5)"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyter": {
          "sceneClass": "LinearTransformationScene"
        }
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": "matrix = [[1, 1], [0, 1]]\nself.apply_matrix(matrix, run_time=1.8)\nself.wait(0.5)"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyter": {
          "sceneClass": "LinearTransformationScene"
        }
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": "inverse_matrix = [[1, -1], [0, 1]]\nself.apply_matrix(inverse_matrix, run_time=1.8)\nself.play(Indicate(vector, color=GREEN), Indicate(unit_square, color=GREEN))\nself.wait(0.5)"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "# SpecialThreeDScene 示例\n\n这个 Notebook 演示特殊三维预设提供的默认相机、`get_axes()` 和 `get_sphere()`。它与普通 `ThreeDScene` 分开保存，便于直接比较。",
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyterTypst": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyter": {
          "sceneClass": "SpecialThreeDScene"
        }
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": "title = Text(\"SpecialThreeDScene\", font_size=30, color=YELLOW).to_edge(UP)\nself.add_fixed_in_frame_mobjects(title)\nself.set_camera_to_default_position()\naxes = self.get_axes()\nsphere = self.get_sphere(color=BLUE, fill_opacity=0.55).scale(0.8)\nself.play(Write(title))\nself.play(Create(axes), FadeIn(sphere), run_time=2.0)\nself.wait(0.5)"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyter": {
          "sceneClass": "SpecialThreeDScene"
        }
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": "equator = Circle(radius=1.6, color=YELLOW).rotate(PI / 2, axis=RIGHT)\nself.play(Create(equator))\nself.begin_ambient_camera_rotation(rate=0.3)\nself.play(sphere.animate.set_fill(PURPLE, opacity=0.6), run_time=1.5)\nself.wait(1.0)\nself.stop_ambient_camera_rotation()"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "manimJupyter": {
          "sceneClass": "SpecialThreeDScene"
        }
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": "self.move_camera(phi=55 * DEGREES, theta=35 * DEGREES, zoom=1.05, run_time=1.6)\nself.play(Rotate(sphere, angle=PI / 2, axis=UP), Indicate(title, color=GREEN))\nself.wait(0.5)"
    }
  ]
}